{"id":"en_granny-shines-for-herself","title":"Granny Shines for Herself","titleEn":"Granny Shines for Herself","description":"Ye Qing gets a second chance at life, waking up in the 1980s as the wife of a military man. In her past existence, she had been idle and had trapped Song Qinian into marriage by calling in a life-saving debt, even slipping him drugs to force intimacy. Determined to rewrite her fate this time, she asks for a divorce, and Song Qinian, wanting to honor her wish, helps her secure a position at a department store. There she starts at the bottom as a cleaner, enduring relentless harassment from Bai Xiaolian, but her diligence lifts her to sales assistant. A live-streamed promotion of foundation cream during a special event turns her into a sudden sensation. After she rescues a neighbor's son from harm, Song Qinian's opinion of her softens. In time, she launches both a beauty salon and a cosmetic","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/granny-shines-for-herself/en_US/cf4a25562a758e10/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/granny-shines-for-herself/en_US/cf4a25562a758e10/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Glow-Up","Revenge","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dnf1m/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_granny-shines-for-herself_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dnf1m/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_granny-shines-for-herself_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dnf1m/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_granny-shines-for-herself_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rum